---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '~/lib/site';
const updated = '2026-04-19';
---

<Base title="Terms" description="Terms of use for Glitch Trade." pageType="WebPage">
  <section class="container-app py-20 max-w-prose-tight">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-subtle text-fluid-sm">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose mt-10 text-muted [&_h2]:text-fg [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-3 [&_h2]:text-fluid-xl [&_p]:my-3 [&_strong]:text-fg [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_li]:my-1.5 [&_a]:text-brand">
      <p>
        By accessing {site.domain} or using the Glitch Trade bot, you agree to
        these terms. The service is operated by {site.parent}. Nothing on this
        site or in the bot constitutes a binding offer, a recommendation, or
        professional advice — it is marketing and software.
      </p>

      <h2>No investment advice</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Glitch Trade does not provide investment, financial, legal, or
        tax advice.</strong> The signals, models, analysis, and commentary
        generated by the bot or described on this site are information only.
        They are not an offer or solicitation to buy, sell, or hold any asset,
        and they are not tailored to your personal financial situation, risk
        tolerance, or regulatory position. You are solely responsible for every
        trading decision you make. If you need advice, consult a licensed
        financial professional in your jurisdiction.
      </p>

      <h2>Past performance &amp; backtests</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Past performance does not guarantee future results.</strong>
        Any historical metrics, backtests, or simulated results shown on this
        site or inside the bot are hypothetical. Backtests have inherent
        limitations — they may not reflect real-world execution, slippage,
        liquidity, partial fills, exchange downtime, or adverse market
        conditions. Live trading outcomes will differ from simulated ones,
        often materially.
      </p>

      <h2>Trading risk</h2>
      <p>
        Trading cryptocurrencies and other financial instruments involves a
        substantial risk of loss and is not suitable for every investor. You
        can lose some or all of the capital you commit. Do not trade with
        money you cannot afford to lose. You are responsible for understanding
        the fee structure, margin mechanics, and liquidation terms of any
        exchange you connect to Glitch Trade.
      </p>

      <h2>Regional eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        Cryptocurrency services are regulated differently in every
        jurisdiction. Some regions restrict or prohibit access to specific
        trading products, bots, or exchanges. You are responsible for
        verifying that your use of Glitch Trade complies with the laws,
        regulations, and tax rules of the country and state/province where
        you reside and trade. If local law prohibits you from using automated
        trading tools, you may not use the service.
      </p>

      <h2>API keys &amp; custody</h2>
      <p>
        Glitch Trade connects to your exchange via API keys that you provide.
        We require keys with trade-only permissions (no withdrawal access).
        We never custody client funds, and we never request withdrawal
        permissions. API keys are encrypted at rest. You are responsible for
        revoking keys if you cancel the service.
      </p>

      <h2>Marks &amp; content</h2>
      <p>
        "Glitch Executor", "Glitch Trade", the cobra mascot, and related marks
        are property of {site.parent}. Copy and screenshots are copyrighted and
        cannot be reproduced commercially without written permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The site, the bot, and any signal or analysis output are provided
        <em>as-is</em> and without warranties of any kind, express or implied.
        We do not warrant uninterrupted access, error-free operation, or any
        particular financial outcome. To the maximum extent permitted by
        applicable law, {site.parent} disclaims liability for trading losses,
        missed signals, delayed execution, exchange outages, or data
        inaccuracies.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Legal notices: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
